  "categorias": "Noticias|Política",
  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/11/IMG_9439.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>A m&eacute;s de Mari Carmen Aguilella Garcia, ex-primera tinent d&#39;alcaldia d&#39;Onda i n&uacute;mero tres de la candidatura socialista al Congr&eacute;s, han&nbsp; intervingut Ximo Huguet Lecha, secretari general del PSPV-PSOE onder i diputat provincial, Susana Ros Mart&iacute;nez, cap de llista, Artemi Rallo Lombarte, candidat al Senat, Ernest Blanch Mar&iacute;n, secretari general socialista a la prov&iacute;ncia de Castell&oacute;, i ha tancat l&#39;acte Mar&iacute;a Jos&eacute; Salvador Rubert, vice-presidenta de les Corts Valencianes. En tots els parlament han inistit en la necessitat de votar diumenge per a aconseguir un govern progressista fort.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mitingpsoeeleccionsgeneralsonda/img_9401.jpg\" alt=\"img_9401\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mitingpsoeeleccionsgeneralsonda/img_9404.jpg\" alt=\"img_9404\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mitingpsoeeleccionsgeneralsonda/img_9405.jpg\" alt=\"img_9405\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mitingpsoeeleccionsgeneralsonda/img_9406.jpg\" alt=\"img_9406\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mitingpsoeeleccionsgeneralsonda/img_9409.jpg\" alt=\"img_9409\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mitingpsoeeleccionsgeneralsonda/img_9411.jpg\" alt=\"img_9411\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mitingpsoeelec